  Subtitle: Low Earth orbit - debris field
  Briefing: 'The Swarm vanguard is tearing through our satellite grid.

    Clear
    the orbital sector and stop their scout carrier, The Destroyer.


    Drag to
    move. Your laser fires automatically.

    Blue crates upgrade your weapon; green
    ones restore shields.'
  Objectives: '- Destroy every Swarm wave

    - Defeat Sentinel-X

    - Destroy
    The Destroyer'
